Subject: [PATCH 15/19] fix(ui): fix sidebar dividers stretching in flex
 containers

- Change min-h-[1px] to h-[1px] on sidebar separator dividers to prevent
  flex stretching in DashboardRouter and ServerRouter
- Scope .innerLogo CSS rule to .main-header .logo only, preventing the
  admin sidebar logo from expanding during page transitions
- Update patch 0011 with all fixes to keep patch and source in sync

